---
source: ilass-cli/tests/align.rs
expression: "align(\"oppenheimer.in.srt\", \"oppenheimer.ref.srt\")"
---
1
00:00:00,625 --> 00:00:04,064
We knew the world
would not be the same.

2
00:00:05,845 --> 00:00:09,064
Few people laughed.

3
00:00:09,965 --> 00:00:11,124
Few people cried.

4
00:00:12,165 --> 00:00:15,504
Most people were silent.

5
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:20,953
I remembered the line
from the Hindu scripture,

6
00:00:20,965 --> 00:00:23,824
the Bhagavad Gita.

7
00:00:25,665 --> 00:00:26,364
Vishnu

8
00:00:28,785 --> 00:00:34,134
is trying to persuade the
prince that he should do his

9
00:00:34,145 --> 00:00:42,233
duty and to impress him, takes
on his multi-armed form and

10
00:00:42,244 --> 00:00:50,393
says, "Now, I am become death,
the destroyer of worlds."

11
00:00:50,404 --> 00:00:53,324
I suppose we all thought
that one way or another.
